    h3.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-800.dark:text-white.mb-4.flex.items-center
      svg.w-6.h-6.mr-2.text-blue-600.dark:text-blue-400 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"
      | Contact
    .text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300.space-y-4
      p
        | Feel free to contact us for beta access applications, bug reports, feature requests, etc. We look forward to hearing from you.
      .flex
        a.inline-flex.items-center.gap-2.px-6.py-3.bg-blue-600.dark:bg-blue-700.text-white.rounded-lg.hover:bg-blue-700.dark:hover:bg-blue-600.transition.font-semibold href="https://forms.gle/a6EYBBxhMdGc4TJq6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          | Contact Form
          svg.w-4.h-4 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"

